    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Amends 003 and 004 so Statecraft may adopt wire-witness as an exact linked producer, bracket one sidecar as its own durable effect, supply one per-attempt loopback proxy endpoint to the child, and report confinement and witness posture without treating testimony as authority or creating a general sidecar host.\n",
    "title": "Supervised adoption of one wire-witness sidecar per attempt"
